      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly and caring at every level"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The overwhelmingly dominant theme across recent reviews is the warmth and professionalism of the entire team. Reception staff, nurses, and vets are all praised by name and in general. Several owners travel further than necessary to stay with this practice, and first-time visitors describe immediately feeling at ease. The atmosphere is consistently described as welcoming and unhurried."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient handling of nervous pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners of anxious dogs, cats that dislike handling, and complex-needs animals report that the team adapts confidently to each pet. Nervous animals are calmed with gentle reassurance and practical techniques — one reviewer notes their cat requires sedation and is always managed calmly and professionally."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and genuine support"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight that procedures and treatments are explained clearly at every stage, with owners leaving appointments feeling fully informed. One owner credits the practice with answering numerous questions about a new cat. During end-of-life visits, the team is described as compassionate in explaining every option and supporting the family throughout."
      }
    }
  ],
